sequenceDiagram
  participant A as Machine A canonical root
  participant K as Recovery key export (out of band)
  participant V as OneDrive vault (encrypted snapshots only)
  participant B as Machine B
  A->>A: Enroll recovery key and writer
  A->>K: Export independent recovery key
  A->>V: Publish encrypted snapshot (sequence N)
  K->>B: Deliver recovery key outside OneDrive
  B->>V: Fetch snapshot
  B->>B: Authenticate and stage restore
  B->>B: Activate separate canonical root and workspace via descriptor (ADR-023)
  Note over B: History, accounting, unfinished children preserved<br/>· machine authority revoked · paused and untrusted
  B->>V: Publish encrypted snapshot (sequence N+1)
  A->>V: Fetch return snapshot
  A->>A: Authenticate against retained checkpoint, restore beside unchanged original root
